From: Mark Harfouche <mark.harfouche@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 28 Jun 2026 15:11:39 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Remove upper bound pin on av dependency

<details><summary>Claude's draft</summary>

Drop the `<17.0.0` upper bound on the `av` dependency in pyproject.toml,
leaving only the `>=14.0.0` lower bound. This allows installing newer
PyAV releases without a packaging constraint.

Resume this Claude session:
```
cd /Users/mark/git/aiortc-qsv
claude --resume 3a69e574-7baa-4835-898e-ebecf85bf921
```
</details>
---
 pyproject.toml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/pyproject.toml b/pyproject.toml
index 9da388d..d2f2d02 100644
--- a/pyproject.toml
+++ b/pyproject.toml
@@ -26,7 +26,7 @@ classifiers = [
 ]
 dependencies = [
     "aioice>=0.10.2,<1.0.0",
-    "av>=14.0.0,<18.0.0",
+    "av>=14.0.0",
     "cryptography>=44.0.0",
     "google-crc32c>=1.1",
     "pyee>=13.0.0",
-- 
2.54.0

